 Working in close collaboration with ELYSIS’s Operational Readiness Support (ORS) team, the successful candidate will be responsible for :
 Key Activities and Responsibilities
 • Apply the organization’s Health, Safety and Environment (HSE) principles by adopting a positive "Zero by Choice" mindset ;
