 • Demonstrate a strong commitment to protecting ELYSIS intellectual property ;
 • Possess excellent initiative, resourcefulness, and autonomy ;
 • Show a strong interest in new technologies ;
 • Be proficient in spoken and written French and have a basic knowledge of English. ELYSIS is a global organization, and the responsibilities of this role may require collaboration with colleagues, teams, or partners located outside of Quebec;
