 About Us
 A world-class partnership between two pioneering leaders of the aluminum industry, Alcoa and Rio Tinto, led to the creation of ELYSIS in 2018. Through this joint venture, supported by the Government of Quebec, the team is working to develop and commercialize a breakthrough technology on a global scale.
 ELYSIS™ technology eliminates all direct greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions from the aluminum smelting process. It is the first industrial process that emits oxygen as its by-product. ELYSIS has demonstrated its ability to produce commercial-grade aluminum for end users ranging from Apple to Audi, and the technology is currently being designed for use in both new smelter construction projects and modernization initiatives.
